        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;She hears a clapping sound- as if Adora clapped her hands together -and Adora mumbling, â€œPlease, forgive meâ€¦â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Then, Catraâ€™s eyes snap open- because Adoraâ€™s kissing her. Adoraâ€™s eyes are closed, and she pulls back slightly- and if she just opened her eyes she would realize Catra is awake. Adoraâ€™s hand rests on the side of her face, thumb just underneath her mouth, and pulls her mouth slightly open. Adora descends again, their open lips making contact-&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;And thatâ€™s when Catra realizesâ€¦ Adora isnâ€™t kissing her, she's trying to give her CPR!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Â &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;or, in which Catra is a Ghost, Adora is a god, and they're still searching for Shadow Weaver... and Adora doesn't understand how ghost's work.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
